      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the \"personal opinion\" angle helps. but it's harder when people start talking about the sudden uptick in maritime tension in the strait. it feels so performative, like a very obvious signal being sent while everyone else is looking at the economic fallout of the chip bans. i find myself wanting to point out how the timing is too perfect to be coincidental. how do i pivot when i feel like i'm seeing the actual script being played out instead of just the news?",
